WEBVTT

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:30.670
a parameter that you put in there
to be able to perform.

00:01:31.003 --> 00:01:34.382
But what happens after that
is out of your hands.

00:01:34.423 --> 00:01:36.092
That's the power of music.

00:01:36.134 --> 00:01:38.928
When I'm holding my microphone,

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.972
for me, stage is my sanctuary.

00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:45.893
FO: I was looking up some
of the comments people write

00:01:45.935 --> 00:01:48.604
when they watched you online on YouTube.

00:01:48.646 --> 00:01:51.065
Now, normally I wouldn't do this,
but this is fine.

00:01:51.065 --> 00:01:52.441
This is not scary.

00:01:52.483 --> 00:01:54.777
"Pure love for Mama Angelique.

00:01:54.777 --> 00:01:57.530
A beautiful ball of energy."

00:01:57.572 --> 00:02:00.491
AK: (Laughs)